\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  Rise and shine out of the darkness\cf0 
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Rise and shine Jerusalem
\par Your glamour and your happiness
\par Is risen in Bethlehem
\par Saviour of the world is here
\par Christ the Lord has come to us
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.   Before this light shone upon earth
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 there was darkness all over,
\par and the earth was void without form
\par but to-day has seen great light
\par The star which appeared was seen
\par Lead us to the saviours' side.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  The wise from far came to worship
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 and Herod enquire of you
\par because he wanted to kill you
\par  and he followed your great light
\par but his great rage could not reach
\par you the Saviour of the world.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.   Sinners do not reject he who
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 was able to deliver you
\par Your king him only you worship
\par and become God's own children
\par Hurry up to him alone
\par come to him he is your light.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5. We shall press on doing our best
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0   and race towards him alone
\par  and embrace him whole heartedly
\par  show us your grace Oh! our Lord
\par  as we kneel before you now
\par  we believe and trust in you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.  Help us on to the path of life
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  with your holy spirit guide
\par   encourage us on the war path
\par   so we came out victorious
\par   Captain, let us follow you
\par   let us not desert you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7.   In the darkness of all our toils
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0   shine bright with your joyous light
\par   And if we are being tormented
\par   Christ, please do not desert us
\par   until when we shall arrive
\par   in the heaven's at your side.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8.   If we are in the dark valley
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0   and are getting nearer death
\par   bring us the heavenly comfort
\par   light that gives us happiness
\par   so the light of faith lead us
\par \pard        into death to be with you.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

